WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.334
Turning now to the front lines

00:00:01.334 --> 00:00:02.769
in eastern Ukraine

00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:04.170
where the bloody Russian advance

00:00:04.170 --> 00:00:07.474
is forcing so many civilians to evacuate.

00:00:07.741 --> 00:00:09.642
CNN's senior international correspondent

00:00:09.642 --> 00:00:11.311
Sam Kiley has our report.

00:00:11.311 --> 00:00:12.812
From a town many fear

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:15.348
could be Vladimir Putin's next target

00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:20.053
A year into Russia's invasion,

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:21.187
this monochrome

00:00:21.187 --> 00:00:23.423
misery is all too familiar.

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:25.592
This is what happened

00:00:25.592 --> 00:00:26.993
just three days ago.

00:00:26.993 --> 00:00:31.798
Here in Geneva, an S-300 missile strike.

00:00:31.831 --> 00:00:33.033
Now, that's a missile

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:34.634
used by the Russians

00:00:34.634 --> 00:00:36.803
for ground attack was actually designed

00:00:37.070 --> 00:00:38.571
for bringing down airplanes,

00:00:38.571 --> 00:00:40.573
but it carries a massive warhead.

00:00:40.573 --> 00:00:42.308
It's pretty inaccurate.

00:00:42.308 --> 00:00:43.777
And that doesn't matter to the Russians

00:00:43.777 --> 00:00:46.446
because this is all about smashing up

00:00:46.713 --> 00:00:48.048
the villages and towns

00:00:48.048 --> 00:00:50.050
ahead of what the Ukrainians fear

00:00:50.050 --> 00:00:51.985
is going to be a major Russian push

00:00:51.985 --> 00:00:53.219
in this part of the country.

00:00:54.287 --> 00:00:54.954
Captured on the

00:00:54.954 --> 00:00:57.157
second day of Vladimir Putin's invasion

00:00:57.157 --> 00:00:58.425
last February.

00:00:58.425 --> 00:01:00.293
This is no longer a town

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:02.162
that scares easily.

00:01:02.162 --> 00:01:04.464
It was liberated by Ukraine in the fall

00:01:04.798 --> 00:01:05.799
and is within mortar

00:01:05.799 --> 00:01:08.468
range of Russian troops today.

00:01:08.468 --> 00:01:10.804
Yet these teenagers are taking a walk

00:01:11.271 --> 00:01:13.873
through what remains of their village.

00:01:13.873 --> 00:01:16.309
Why do your parents not insist

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:18.545
that you all leave as a family?

00:01:20.113 --> 00:01:21.548
My dad has a farm here.

00:01:21.548 --> 00:01:22.615
He's got land

00:01:22.615 --> 00:01:24.150
and we can't just leave it all behind,

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:25.151
she says.

00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:26.119
Across the

00:01:26.119 --> 00:01:27.987
So we just don't want to go yet.

00:01:27.987 --> 00:01:29.489
Well, if it gets serious,

00:01:29.489 --> 00:01:32.125
then we'll leave it at the Jeep

00:01:32.125 --> 00:01:33.093
attacking you.

00:01:33.093 --> 00:01:34.928
And how would you define really serious?

00:01:34.928 --> 00:01:36.296
In most countries?

00:01:36.296 --> 00:01:37.263
Having a missile

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:39.299
that big land in the middle of town

00:01:39.532 --> 00:01:41.968
is already really serious.

00:01:41.968 --> 00:01:43.303
No water serious.

00:01:43.303 --> 00:01:44.337
And it's actually

00:01:44.337 --> 00:01:45.205
very serious

00:01:45.205 --> 00:01:45.705
is probably

00:01:45.705 --> 00:01:47.640
when a lot of houses are destroyed

00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:50.009
and civilians suffer, she explains.

00:01:50.343 --> 00:01:51.244
That is that you?

00:01:52.412 --> 00:01:53.780
It's the defiance of

00:01:53.780 --> 00:01:55.248
Ukrainian civilians

00:01:55.248 --> 00:01:57.584
that Russia is trying to crush.

00:01:57.584 --> 00:01:59.452
Putin's rockets and artillery

00:01:59.452 --> 00:02:01.054
have rained down on towns

00:02:01.054 --> 00:02:02.889
from Kherson to Kramatorsk

00:02:02.889 --> 00:02:04.057
to Cookie, UNSC

00:02:04.057 --> 00:02:05.091
and the northern border

00:02:05.091 --> 00:02:06.192
with Russia

00:02:06.192 --> 00:02:08.895
along a front line of 1300 kilometers.

00:02:08.895 --> 00:02:12.499
That's 800 miles

00:02:12.832 --> 00:02:14.868
this latest assault on her son,

00:02:14.868 --> 00:02:16.269
another example

00:02:16.269 --> 00:02:17.504
of the indiscriminate

00:02:17.504 --> 00:02:20.073
shelling of civilians.

00:02:20.073 --> 00:02:21.774
This isn't accidental.

00:02:21.774 --> 00:02:23.977
It's deliberate.

00:02:24.244 --> 00:02:26.980
The areas liberated by Ukraine bear

00:02:26.980 --> 00:02:28.281
the brunt of an ever

00:02:28.281 --> 00:02:30.817
increasing level of attacks by Russia.

00:02:33.052 --> 00:02:34.621
Here in co-pilot's province,

00:02:34.621 --> 00:02:35.989
as in her son.

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:38.458
Civilians survive on aid rations.

00:02:38.992 --> 00:02:40.560
The mother who said

00:02:40.560 --> 00:02:41.494
we don't know what to do,

00:02:41.494 --> 00:02:43.563
she says houses are shaking.

00:02:43.563 --> 00:02:44.797
Missiles are flying.

00:02:44.797 --> 00:02:46.499
We just don't know what to wait for

00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:48.067
was shaking like chickens.

00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:50.136
We don't know what to expect.

00:02:50.136 --> 00:02:51.538
Gruesome stuff So far, the

00:02:52.572 --> 00:02:54.507
fighting has been most intense in

00:02:54.507 --> 00:02:54.908
and around

00:02:54.908 --> 00:02:57.243
parliament with a surge in attacks

00:02:57.243 --> 00:02:59.279
by Russia on nearby villages.

00:02:59.279 --> 00:03:00.413
In a foretaste

00:03:00.413 --> 00:03:04.184
of the anticipated offensive

00:03:05.084 --> 00:03:05.552
Veterans

00:03:05.552 --> 00:03:07.520
like Alex, who captured this tank

00:03:07.520 --> 00:03:08.688
called Bunny

00:03:08.688 --> 00:03:09.455
from Russia

00:03:09.455 --> 00:03:10.590
last March,

00:03:10.590 --> 00:03:12.659
are running low on ammunition.

00:03:12.659 --> 00:03:13.459
He says that he

00:03:13.459 --> 00:03:15.061
sometimes is in combat

00:03:15.061 --> 00:03:17.497
with only ten shells a day.

00:03:17.497 --> 00:03:18.531
It's really hard.

00:03:18.531 --> 00:03:20.700
We have a lot of casualties every day.

00:03:21.234 --> 00:03:23.970
And the problem is that

00:03:23.970 --> 00:03:26.272
the fighting moved inside the city

00:03:26.506 --> 00:03:28.341
because like we are fighting

00:03:28.341 --> 00:03:30.009
like building to building

00:03:30.009 --> 00:03:33.079
and the distance is like 25 to 60 meters.

00:03:33.079 --> 00:03:34.480
So we cannot use artillery.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:35.748
Well here.

00:03:35.748 --> 00:03:37.417
Civilians place their faith

00:03:37.417 --> 00:03:38.685
in Ukraine's forces

00:03:38.685 --> 00:03:41.054
to hold off the Russians

00:03:41.054 --> 00:03:43.423
and play their part by staying on

00:03:44.123 --> 00:03:46.392
and staying alive.

00:03:46.392 --> 00:03:46.793
Now, Wolf,

00:03:46.793 --> 00:03:48.127
according to the local authorities

00:03:48.127 --> 00:03:48.628
in Kazan,

00:03:48.628 --> 00:03:49.162
at least

00:03:49.162 --> 00:03:50.730
six people were killed,

00:03:50.730 --> 00:03:51.531
more than a dozen

00:03:51.531 --> 00:03:53.700
injured in the use of multiple rocket

00:03:53.700 --> 00:03:54.867
launching systems

00:03:54.867 --> 00:03:56.436
and indiscriminate weapon.

00:03:56.436 --> 00:03:58.871
Clearly intending to try to terrify

00:03:58.871 --> 00:04:00.139
the civilian population,

00:04:00.139 --> 00:04:01.574
as we say in that report,

00:04:01.574 --> 00:04:03.076
the civilian population by

00:04:03.076 --> 00:04:03.610
and large in

00:04:03.610 --> 00:04:04.911
this country is remaining

00:04:04.911 --> 00:04:06.379
incredibly resolute

00:04:06.379 --> 00:04:07.614
after 12 months

00:04:07.614 --> 00:04:09.649
of agony, of war, of murder,

00:04:09.649 --> 00:04:10.783
of shortages,

00:04:10.783 --> 00:04:11.351
of mass

00:04:11.351 --> 00:04:12.852
movements, of refugees,

00:04:12.852 --> 00:04:14.087
and in many cities,

00:04:14.087 --> 00:04:15.488
particularly places

00:04:15.488 --> 00:04:16.589
in the east, like Kharkiv,

00:04:16.589 --> 00:04:17.023
where I am

00:04:17.023 --> 00:04:18.925
now, or Kramatorsk

00:04:18.925 --> 00:04:21.160
The population is actually beginning

00:04:21.160 --> 00:04:22.195
to return to something

00:04:22.195 --> 00:04:24.197
approaching normal, particularly

00:04:24.197 --> 00:04:26.232
because the Russians were pushed back

00:04:26.232 --> 00:04:27.100
from those gains

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:27.767
they made

00:04:27.767 --> 00:04:30.503
in the early stages of the war Wolf.

00:04:30.503 --> 00:04:31.771
Sam Kiley reporting for us.

00:04:31.771 --> 00:04:32.572
Stay safe over there.

00:04:32.572 --> 00:04:33.706
Thank you very, very much.

